@startuml
title Modelo físico final - Arquitectura multiservidor WhatsApp distribuido

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

actor "Cliente A\nClienteNodo" as CA
actor "Cliente B\nClienteNodo" as CB
actor "Cliente C\nClienteNodo" as CC

cloud "LAN / localhost para demo\n o máquinas distintas en red local" as LAN {

  node "JVM 1\nServerNode node1\nclientPort=5001\npeerPort=6001" as N1 {
    component "Servidor local de clientes" as N1Client
    component "PeerListener :6001" as N1Peer
    database "Estado local node1\nsesiones, directorio,\ngrupos, membresía" as N1State
  }

  node "JVM 2\nServerNode node2\nclientPort=5002\npeerPort=6002" as N2 {
    component "Servidor local de clientes" as N2Client
    component "PeerListener :6002" as N2Peer
    database "Estado local node2\nsesiones, directorio,\ngrupos, membresía" as N2State
  }

  node "JVM 3\nServerNode node3\nclientPort=5003\npeerPort=6003" as N3 {
    component "Servidor local de clientes" as N3Client
    component "PeerListener :6003" as N3Peer
    database "Estado local node3\nsesiones, directorio,\ngrupos, membresía" as N3State
  }
}

CA --> N1Client : TCP cliente-servidor\nPaqueteRed serializable
CB --> N2Client : TCP cliente-servidor\nPaqueteRed serializable
CC --> N3Client : TCP cliente-servidor\nPaqueteRed serializable

N1Peer <--> N2Peer : TCP inter-nodo\nNodeMessage / AppMessage
N1Peer <--> N3Peer : TCP inter-nodo\nNodeMessage / AppMessage
N2Peer <--> N3Peer : TCP inter-nodo\nNodeMessage / AppMessage

note right of LAN
Cada ServerNode corre como proceso/JVM independiente.
La demo puede ejecutarse en localhost usando distintos puertos,
pero el modelo es equivalente a máquinas distintas dentro de una LAN.
end note

note bottom of N1
node1.properties
host=localhost
clientPort=5001
peerPort=6001
end note

note bottom of N2
node2.properties
host=localhost
clientPort=5002
peerPort=6002
end note

note bottom of N3
node3.properties
host=localhost
clientPort=5003
peerPort=6003
end note


@enduml